https://example.com/comments/1

### get all movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies HTTP/1.1

### Get movie by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/7

### Invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "director": "Nobody"
}

### create first movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner",
  "director": "Ridley Scott",
  "year": 1982
}

### create another movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "The great dictator",
  "director": "Charlie Chaplin",
  "year": 1940
}

### replace a movie
put  http://localhost:3000/movies/4 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  
  "year": 2026
}

### delete movie
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1 HTTP/1.1


### Partially update a movie
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2000
}

### Filter and sort movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi&minYear=2000&sort=year

### Invalid query parameter
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=invalid

### Delete a movie
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Delete the same movie again
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Unknown route
GET http://localhost:3000/does-not-exist
